## Quick Command Cheat Sheet

| Task | Command |
| --- | --- |
| Install Playwright | `npm init playwright@latest` |
| Install browsers | `npx playwright install` |
| Run all tests | `npx playwright test` |
| Run one file | `npx playwright test tests/login.spec.js` |
| Run by browser | `npx playwright test --project=chromium` |
| Run by tag or title | `npx playwright test --grep @smoke` |
| Headed mode | `npx playwright test --headed` |
| UI mode | `npx playwright test --ui` |
| Debug mode | `npx playwright test --debug` |
| Parallel workers | `npx playwright test --workers=4` |
| Retries | `npx playwright test --retries=2` |
| Repeat to check flakiness | `npx playwright test --repeat-each=10` |
| Sharding | `npx playwright test --shard=1/3` |
